Package: tind-optins
Version: 0.1.9
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec, flatpak, curl, ca-certificates, tind-extras (>= 0.1.10)
Installed-Size: 96
Description: Tind Apps: opt-in application installer
 A small window for the apps Tind does not install by default: the app boxes
 from the installer (games, developer tools, entertainment, creative,
 communication, productivity and cloud, printers and scanners, security) and
 the AI assistant. Each box opens a list of its apps, so single apps can be
 installed; installed apps are shown greyed out. Boxes are described by small
 files in /usr/share/tind/optins.d, and everything can also be installed from
 the command line (tind-optins --list, tind-optins install box:app).
